---
/**
 * Renders the word "BUXENA" using the exact lettering from the official
 * logo artwork (masked, so it takes on whatever color the surrounding
 * heading already uses) instead of the page's regular typeface. Drop into
 * any prominent branded heading/eyebrow, e.g. `Why <BuxenaMark />`.
 *
 * Not for body copy — this is for display-type brand moments only.
 */
---

<span class="buxena-mark-wrap">
  <span class="buxena-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span class="sr-only">BUXENA</span>
</span>

<style>
  .buxena-mark-wrap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .buxena-mark {
    display: inline-block;
    width: calc(1224 / 210 * 1em);
    height: 1em;
    background-color: currentColor;
    -webkit-mask-image: url('/brand/buxena-wordmark-mark.png');
    mask-image: url('/brand/buxena-wordmark-mark.png');
    -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    mask-repeat: no-repeat;
    -webkit-mask-size: contain;
    mask-size: contain;
    -webkit-mask-position: center;
    mask-position: center;
  }
</style>
